# Bouncer VIP Platform - Observability Stack
# Monitoring, Logging, and Tracing Configuration

## Prometheus Stack

```yaml
# infrastructure/k8s/monitoring/prometheus.yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: Namespace
metadata:
  name: monitoring
---
apiVersion: v1
kind: ServiceAccount
metadata:
  name: prometheus
  namespace: monitoring
---
apiVersion: rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1
kind: ClusterRole
metadata:
  name: prometheus
rules:
- apiGroups: [""]
  resources:
  - nodes
  - nodes/metrics
  - services
  - endpoints
  - pods
  verbs: ["get", "list", "watch"]
- apiGroups: [""]
  resources:
  - configmaps
  verbs: ["get"]
---
apiVersion: v1
kind: ConfigMap
metadata:
  name: prometheus-config
  namespace: monitoring
data:
  prometheus.yml: |
    global:
      scrape_interval: 15s
      evaluation_interval: 15s
    
    scrape_configs:
    - job_name: 'kubernetes-nodes'
      scrape_interval: 30s
      static_configs:
      - targets: ['localhost:9100']
    
    - job_name: 'bouncer-services'
      scrape_interval: 15s
      kubernetes_sd_configs:
      - role: pod
      relabel_configs:
      - source_labels: [__meta_kubernetes_pod_annotation_prometheus_io_scrape]
        action: keep
        regex: true
```

## Grafana Dashboards

```yaml
# infrastructure/k8s/monitoring/grafana.yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: ConfigMap
metadata:
  name: grafana-dashboards
  namespace: monitoring
data:
  dashboard.json: |
    {
      "dashboard": {
        "title": "Bouncer VIP Platform",
        "uid": "bouncer-vip",
        "panels": [
          {
            "title": "Request Rate",
            "type": "graph",
            "targets": [
              {"expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total[5m]))"}
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Error Rate",
            "type": "graph", 
            "targets": [
              {"expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{status=~\"5..\"}[5m]))"}
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Latency P99",
            "type": "graph",
            "targets": [
              {"expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m]))"}
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Active Connections",
            "type": "gauge",
            "targets": [
              {"expr": "active_connections"}
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
```

